# UX workflow: copy one sequencer page and preview normal-mode paste targets.
# Purpose: validates clipboard source marker plus overwrite/free paste previews
# outside structure selection mode.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen sequencer_ready

# Create page 2 and copy it.
150 encoder NAV 1
250 capture screen page_2_add_preview
350 tap NAV 60
550 capture screen page_2_created
650 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
850 capture screen page_2_copied

# Move to active page 1. Paste preview should show source page 2 in blue and
# overwrite target page 1 in amber. Holding paste should use the overwrite
# warning tone.
950 encoder NAV -1
1150 capture screen paste_preview_overwrite_page_1
1250 button BOTTOM_RIGHT down
1800 tick
1850 capture screen paste_hold_overwrite_armed
2350 tick
2400 button BOTTOM_RIGHT up
2650 capture screen page_1_overwritten

# Move to inactive page 3. Paste preview should show source page 2 in blue and
# free target page 3 in green. Holding paste should use the constructive tone.
2750 encoder NAV 1
2850 encoder NAV 1
3050 capture screen paste_preview_free_page_3
3150 button BOTTOM_RIGHT down
3700 tick
3750 capture screen paste_hold_free_armed
4250 tick
4300 button BOTTOM_RIGHT up
4550 capture screen page_3_pasted
